<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TechBot - Automatización Inteligente 24/7</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Automatiza tu consultorio, clínica o negocio con TechBot. Agendamiento IA 24/7 y gestión de clientes vía WhatsApp.">
    
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- Iconos -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #030712;
            --bg-card: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.7);
            --primary: #f59e0b;     /* Amber 500 */
            --primary-glow: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
            --accent: #fbbf24;      /* Amber 400 */
            --text-main: #f9fafb;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --border-light: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- Fondos Dinámicos --- */
        .bg-glow {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 50%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 30%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%);
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .grid-pattern {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 50px 50px;
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* --- Navbar --- */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; width: 100%;
            padding: 1.2rem 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo span {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .btn-login {
            color: var(--text-main);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        
        .btn-login:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .btn-cta {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            color: #000;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--primary-glow);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-cta:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px var(--primary-glow);
        }

        /* --- Hero Section --- */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 5%;
            padding-top: 100px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero-content {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 650px;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 4.5rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
        }

        h1 span {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-desc {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            max-width: 500px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .hero-visual {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* --- iPhone Mockup --- */
        .phone-mockup {
            width: 320px;
            height: 650px;
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 12px solid #1f2937;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 
                0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
                0 0 80px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
            overflow: hidden;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .phone-mockup::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 150px; height: 30px;
            background: #1f2937;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 20px;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 20px;
            z-index: 20;
        }

        .chat-screen {
            background: #0b141a;
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"%3E%3Cg fill="%231f2937" fill-opacity="0.4" fill-rule="evenodd"%3E%3Ccircle cx="3" cy="3" r="3"/%3E%3Ccircle cx="13" cy="13" r="3"/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E');
            height: 100%;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            padding-top: 60px;
        }

        .chat-bubble {
            max-width: 85%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            position: relative;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: popIn 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .bubble-bot {
            background: #1f2c34;
            color: #e9edef;
            align-self: flex-start;
            border-top-left-radius: 4px;
        }

        .bubble-user {
            background: #005c4b;
            color: #e9edef;
            align-self: flex-end;
            border-top-right-radius: 4px;
        }

        @keyframes popIn {
            0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px) scale(0.9); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
        }

        /* --- Features Section --- */
        .features {
            padding: 6rem 5%;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .section-header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .icon-box {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2), rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05));
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* --- Pricing Section --- */
        .pricing {
            padding: 6rem 5%;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .pricing-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .plan-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .plan-card.highlight {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05) 0%, var(--bg-card) 100%);
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
        }

        .popular-tag {
            position: absolute;
            top: -14px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            color: #000;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px var(--primary-glow);
        }

        .plan-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .price span {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .plan-features {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 2.5rem 0;
        }

        .plan-features li {
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: center;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .plan-features li i {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .plan-features li.disabled {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        .plan-features li.disabled i {
            color: #374151;
        }

        /* --- Carousel Section --- */
        .carousel-section {
            padding: 6rem 5%;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05), transparent, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05));
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        .carousel-track-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        .carousel-track {
            display: flex;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .carousel-slide {
            min-width: calc(100% / 3 - 1.4rem);
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .carousel-slide .stars {
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .carousel-slide p {
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .carousel-slide .author {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .author-avatar {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .author-info h4 { font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .author-info span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

        .carousel-nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .carousel-dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .carousel-dot.active {
            background: var(--primary);
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .carousel-slide { min-width: calc(100% / 2 - 1rem); }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .carousel-slide { min-width: 100%; }
        }

        /* --- Footer --- */
        footer {
            padding: 4rem 5% 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* --- Modal Signup --- */
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
            z-index: 2000;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .modal.active {
            display: flex;
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .modal-content {
            background: #111827;
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 480px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            position: relative;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .modal.active .modal-content {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .close-modal {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px; right: 24px;
            background: none; border: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        
        .close-modal:hover { color: #fff; }

        .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: left; }
        .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .form-group input, .form-group select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: #fff;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }
        
        .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }

        .trial-badge {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            color: #34d399;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        /* --- Responsive --- */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding-top: 130px; gap: 3rem; }
            .hero-content { margin: 0 auto; }
            .hero-buttons { justify-content: center; }
            .hero-visual { justify-content: center; width: 100%; }
            h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; }
            .nav-links { display: none; } /* En móvil simplificamos el navbar */
            .plan-card.highlight { transform: none; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
            .hero-buttons { flex-direction: column; }
            .hero-buttons .btn-cta, .hero-buttons .btn-outline { width: 100%; }
            .modal-content { padding: 2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="bg-glow"></div>
    <div class="grid-pattern"></div>

    <!-- Nav -->
    <nav>
        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-robot" style="color: var(--primary);"></i> 
            Bot<span>SaaS</span>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#features">Características</a>
            <a href="#pricing">Planes</a>
            <a href="/auth/login" class="btn-login">Iniciar Sesión</a>
            <button class="btn-cta" onclick="openSignup('pro')">Prueba Gratis</button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Impulsado por Inteligencia Artificial</div>
            <h1>Tu Negocio en <br><span>Autopiloto Total</span></h1>
            <p class="hero-desc">Convierte conversaciones en clientes. Un asistente virtual premium que atiende, agenda y vende por WhatsApp 24/7.</p>
            <div class="hero-buttons">
                <button class="btn-cta" onclick="openSignup('pro')" style="padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">Empezar 7 Días Gratis</button>
                <a href="#features" class="btn-outline">Descubrir más</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual">
            <div class="phone-mockup">
                <div class="chat-screen" id="chatDemo">
                    <!-- Animado por JS -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features -->
    <section id="features" class="features">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Diseñado para Escalar</h2>
            <p>La herramienta definitiva para clínicas, spas y profesionales que valoran su tiempo y la experiencia de sus clientes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i></div>
                <h3>Atención Inmediata</h3>
                <p>Respuestas personalizadas en segundos. Tus clientes nunca se sentirán ignorados, mejorando la retención.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i></div>
                <h3>Agendamiento Autónomo</h3>
                <p>El bot revisa tu disponibilidad real, agenda la cita y envía recordatorios automáticos (24h y 1h antes).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i></div>
                <h3>IA Conversacional</h3>
                <p>Entiende el contexto. No es un simple menú numérico; es Claude AI entrenado con tu catálogo de servicios.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i></div>
                <h3>Métricas en Tiempo Real</h3>
                <p>Dashboard premium para medir ingresos, citas canceladas, conversiones y crecimiento mensual.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn"></i></div>
                <h3>Marketing Proactivo</h3>
                <p>El sistema detecta días flojos y sugiere campañas automáticas para recuperar clientes inactivos.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div>
                <h3>Multi-Pagos Seguros</h3>
                <p>Envía links de pago de Stripe o MercadoPago directo en el chat para asegurar reservaciones.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Carousel / Testimonials -->
    <section class="carousel-section">
        <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2>Casos de Éxito</h2>
            <p>Descubre cómo profesionales como tú están multiplicando sus ingresos mientras trabajan menos.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="carousel-track-container">
            <div class="carousel-track" id="carouselTrack">
                <!-- Slide 1 -->
                <div class="carousel-slide">
                    <div class="stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></div>
                    <p>"Antes perdía horas respondiendo mensajes. Ahora el bot agenda todo automático mientras atiendo pacientes. Mis citas aumentaron un 40% el primer mes."</p>
                    <div class="author">
                        <div class="author-avatar">CD</div>
                        <div class="author-info">
                            <h4>Dra. Mariana López</h4>
                            <span>Clínica Dental Avanzada</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Slide 2 -->
                <div class="carousel-slide">
                    <div class="stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></div>
                    <p>"La mejor inversión del año. El bot no solo agenda, sino que manda el recordatorio 24hrs antes y me redujo las inasistencias casi a cero."</p>
                    <div class="author">
                        <div class="author-avatar">SB</div>
                        <div class="author-info">
                            <h4>Carlos Herrera</h4>
                            <span>Studio Barbershop Premium</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Slide 3 -->
